/// The open inventory screen's slot boxes in menu slot order
/// (`AbstractContainerScreen.leftPos`/`topPos` plus each `Slot.x`/`Slot.y`, 16x16). A box
/// is `[x, y, width, height]` in GUI pixels, with `None` for a hidden slot.
